title: pruned change view for *other's* changes
pid: 49f8979f-9818-4a50-b989-8558f811c44c
body: |2-
  I (or you) can see a "pruned change view" where the base
  is the graph minus the new subscribed-to-content.
  For instance the base graph to me if we have just one repo each
  might be my worktree with your HEAD, and the other graph
  (the side of the straddle farther ahead in time)
  would be my worktree with your worktree. Or maybe
  base is my worktree with your HEAD-1, and the futureward side is
  my worktree with your HEAD (if e.g. I just pulled in your graph changes
  from git).
